## Playground
<button aria-checked="false" aria-label="Follow the beat" class="lib-switch lib-sized lib-focus-ring" data-part="switch" data-size="regular" role="switch" type="button" @click=flip>
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="lib-surface lib-switch__thumb" data-material="handle" data-part="thumb" data-radius="pill">

