## Labelled #1
<label class="lib-text lib-tone lib-switch-row" data-part="row" data-role="body" data-size="small" title="Turns the motion down">
  <span class="lib-switch-row__name" data-part="name">
    {children}
  <button aria-checked="false" class="lib-switch lib-sized lib-focus-ring" data-part="switch" data-size="small" role="switch" type="button" @click=flip>
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="lib-surface lib-switch__thumb" data-material="handle" data-part="thumb" data-radius="pill">

## Labelled #2
<label class="lib-text lib-tone lib-switch-row" data-disabled="true" data-part="row" data-role="body" data-size="small" title="Turns the motion down">
  <span class="lib-switch-row__name" data-part="name">
    {children}
  <button aria-checked="false" class="lib-switch lib-sized lib-focus-ring" data-part="switch" data-size="small" disabled="" role="switch" type="button" @click=flip>
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="lib-surface lib-switch__thumb" data-material="handle" data-part="thumb" data-radius="pill">
